/// Change proposal (implementation)
///
/// One change proposal as the agent gateway keeps it (rec-proposal, keyed by proposal-id; its state follows this machine). The change is projected first; a safe change is cleared at once, a risky one waits for an approver. An apply request is honoured only for a cleared proposal and is refused while it waits for approval or after a rejection.
